From d9d8e401556e4003001f8f0daffb09c7d7178118 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:13:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Technique labels stand on the English labels' line

The technique page's header words (POWER, RANG, SPEC in every language) now stand on the row the original MP stands
on, the Final row draws the same crops 67 rows lower as English does (it used a fixed y that only suited the English
cells), and the technique panel's title and rows stand where the English ones do, with MP back on its original y in
Japanese and Chinese. The crop rows come from tools/localize/systemw.py crop_tables (TECH_LINE, TECH_HEADER_LINE,
TECH_PANEL_LINES); tools/test_label_rows.py checks every label's line in every language.
---
